      <title>Lineup 2.0.3</title>
      <link>https://lineup.caiano.com/</link>
      <sparkle:version>21</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.0.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:releaseNotesLink>https://lineup.caiano.com/release-notes/2.0.3</sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>Lineup 2.0.3</h2>
        <p>Adds an update track in Settings &rarr; General. Stable stays the default and gets tested
        releases. Nightly gets the newest public builds first, which may be less reliable. Returning to
        Stable waits for the next Stable release; Lineup never downgrades itself.</p>
      ]]></description>
